{"id":"en_billionaire-from-midnight-hot-dogs","title":"Billionaire From Midnight Hot Dogs","titleEn":"Billionaire From Midnight Hot Dogs","description":"Framed by the very protégés he had mentored, veteran investigative journalist Ethan lost his job at the newspaper. He then found himself tethered to the Nightlight System, which restricted him to operating a hot dog stand solely between midnight and 4 a.m. Through genuine dedication, he built Midnight Hot Dogs into a late-night institution. His former subordinates, now running the upscale Gilded Night Feast, repeatedly plagiarized his work, smeared him, and sabotaged his business. Eventually, Ethan used solid evidence to clear his name and stood firm against capital pressure. His rivals fell apart under their own falsehoods and accumulating debts. Ethan continues to appear punctually at his stand, open just four hours each night, content in the life he has chosen.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/billionaire-from-midnight-hot-dogs/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/billionaire-from-midnight-hot-dogs/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Short Drama","Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d7op4/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_billionaire-from-midnight-hot-dogs_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d7op4/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_billionaire-from-midnight-hot-dogs_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d7op4/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_billionaire-from-midnight-hot-dogs_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumbl